WEBVTT

00:06:57.807 --> 00:07:00.392
And the unseen, you have to admit,

00:07:00.416 --> 00:07:02.338
doesn't come to us through the senses.

00:07:02.362 --> 00:07:06.105
We don't see those nuclear
reactions in stars.

00:07:06.129 --> 00:07:09.571
We don't see the origin of species.

00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:12.976
We don't see the curvature of space-time,

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.919
and other universes.

00:07:14.943 --> 00:07:17.111
But we know about those things.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:18.878
How?

00:07:19.801 --> 00:07:25.617
Well, the classic empiricist
answer is induction --

00:07:25.641 --> 00:07:28.976
the unseen resembles the seen.

00:07:29.433 --> 00:07:31.060
But it doesn't.